4. ACTION LINE AND SAFETY LINE

Implement these as separate first-class objects.

Action Line:
The line whose confirmed break triggers the setup.

Safety Line:
The opposing trendline used for simulated risk management and invalidation.

Both must be visible in the chart-analysis object.

A setup must not be approved if the required opposing safety structure is unavailable under the selected strategy rules.

Do not silently substitute an arbitrary fixed stop for a missing safety line.

